Validators independently fetch/evaluate evidence
 │
 ▼
Equivalence Principle
 │
 ▼
Consensus
 │
 ▼
Decision stored on GenLayer
```

GenLayer Intelligent Contracts can directly perform web requests and render external webpages. citeturn393305search2turn393305search12

